@startuml FintechDeployment

title Fintech Platform Deployment Architecture

actor User

node "User Device" {
    component Browser
}

node "Docker Host" {

    node "Frontend Container\nReact App\n(port 3000)" {
        component React_App
    }

    node "Backend Container\nFastAPI\n(port 8000)" {
        component FastAPI_API
    }

    node "Database Container\nPostgreSQL 15\n(port 5432)" {
        database PostgreSQL_DB
    }

}

User --> Browser
Browser --> React_App : HTTP (localhost:3000)

React_App --> FastAPI_API : REST API (JSON)
FastAPI_API --> PostgreSQL_DB : SQL

@enduml